OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe new working week will get
OL,6,Foff to a dry and settled start with
OL,7,Fplenty of sunshine and just a light
OL,8,Fwind. Turning very hot in the
OL,9,Fafternoon, with just a little patchy
OL,10,Fcloud developing later on in the day.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FAn isolated shower cannot be
OL,13,Fruled out overnight, but most areas
OL,14,Fwill stay dry. There will be areas of
OL,15,Fcloud drifting across, with clear
OL,16,Fspells at times. A warm night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,171,160,301,260,100,100
