OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FTuesday morning looks
OL,6,Fgenerally fine with some quite hot
OL,7,Fspells of sunshine developing.
OL,8,FHowever, as cloud increases heading
OL,9,Finto the afternoon one or two showers
OL,10,Fare possible.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,13,FWednesday will be a little fresher and
OL,14,Fbreezy with sunshine and scattered
OL,15,Fshowers. Becoming drier and less
OL,16,Fbreezy to end the week with more
OL,17,Fprolonged spells of sunshine, though
OL,18,Fcooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
